The harder negation is pleasure. Pleasure is sustained by thought. A remembered experience is carried over; thought builds image upon image; the image stimulates; and that stimulation is called pleasure. The process may be shown as $\mathrm{Remembered\ Experience}
\xrightarrow{\ \mathrm{thought}\ }
\mathrm{Image\ upon\ image}
\xrightarrow{\ \mathrm{stimulation}\ }
\mathrm{Pleasure}.$

