The point may be written negatively: $\mathrm{Life} \neq
\{\mathrm{Living}\}\cup\{\mathrm{Love}\}\cup\{\mathrm{Death}\}
\quad \hbox{as separate compartments.}$ A better prose version is: life includes living, love, and death as a total movement.

